    "title": "Milton Powell takes over as Bishop Ireton athletic director - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorials ,\n10 hours ago While Milton Powell is not new to the high school on Cambridge Road, he has returned to Bishop Ireton, his former stomping ground, to fill two pairs of shoes. One pair belonged to Dwayne Bryant, who has moved on to lead the athletic program at Brewster Academy in New Hampshire after serving as the Cardinals athletic director and boys basketball coach for the past five years. Read full article\n1",
